Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.50,0:00:03.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,Sunday evening, and winter's first message
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.11,0:00:05.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,just landed in the family group.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.15,0:00:09.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ba asks: who's making adadiya pak this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.15,0:00:15.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,Mummy: I'll make it, but who's bringing the ghee?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.46,0:00:16.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,Pappa: me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.34,0:00:19.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,Ten minutes later, Pappa: how many kilos?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.00,0:00:23.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,Fai: keep my box aside already.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.29,0:00:26.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,And Jay in America: please courier some!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.30,0:00:30.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,Finally, Ba: so who's helping with the stirring?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.25,0:00:32.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,And the whole group goes quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.20,0:00:35.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,Who makes adadiya pak at your place?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.86,0:00:38.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tell us in the comments. Follow Otlo.
